  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your clan is tied to the moon Barrakas - the Lantern.</p>\n<p>Considered the best trackers of the Znir pact, you gain a special sense: imprecise scent with a range of 30 feet. This means you can use your sense of smell to determine the location of a creature, but it remains hidden.</p>\n<p>In addition, you become trained in survival and you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to Survival checks to @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.EA5vuSgJfiHH7plD]{Track} creatures that you have previously sensed with your scent. </p>"
    },
